<title>CANADA: Canada Jan advance Raw Materials Price Index rise.</title>
<headline>Canada Jan advance Raw Materials Price Index rise.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The early estimate for Canada's raw materials price index is for a 0.4 percent rise in January from December, Statistics Canada said on Monday.</p>
<p>    INDEXES			  Jan</p>
<p>    Mineral fuels		 -0.7</p>
<p>    Metals			  +1.9</p>
<p>    Vegetable and animal	-0.4</p>
<p>    Wood			    +1.1</p>
<p>    Index ex mineral fuels    +0.9</p>
<p>The early estimate is based on partial returns and other indicators.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Paul-Romeo Danis at 613-951-3350.)</p>
<p>((--Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745)</p>
</text>
